  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (C): Under AU-C 320.04, materiality is calculated as a percentage of a financial benchmark. When total assets significantly increase due to acquisitions, the materiality amount calculated from that benchmark increases proportionally. AU-C 320.A3 guides benchmark selection based on entity circumstances.
