-- Issues: #3
UPDATE questions SET
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (D): Under AU-C 200.A40, inherent risk and control risk combine to form the risk of material misstatement at the assertion level. Inherent risk reflects susceptibility to misstatement before controls, while control risk reflects control effectiveness. Together they represent the entity''s risk before audit procedures.
